        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn TMxBG, Entry Mortise Box</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n Mortise lock body for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with a 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Entry Mortise Box TMxBG:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For exterior and interior use.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy gauge plated steel mortise case.</li>\r\n<li>Anti-friction brass latch bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Acorn Iron Art Mortise Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the knob. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>",
